From: CEB-GNRD platform <ceb-gnrd@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] configuration: accept externally managed CRPS PSU slots

Startup detection selects megcrps800 only for MEG-CRPS800AOP and uses
generic pmbus for other models. The CRPS slot type keeps its sensor
configuration independent of the selected driver.
Base: entity-manager 27d0e48a6dcd69fd12d92b7528d66853db1d6543 plus patch 0004.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD PSU integration]

diff --git a/schemas/legacy.json b/schemas/legacy.json
--- a/schemas/legacy.json
+++ b/schemas/legacy.json
@@ -1030,6 +1030,7 @@
                         "PLI1209BC",
                         "pmbus",
                         "MEGCRPS800",
+                        "CRPS",
                         "PXE1610",
                         "Q54SN120A1",
                         "Q54SW120A7",
